            "sid": "ISA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.46.2+JER.46.3+JER.46.4+JER.46.5+JER.46.6+JER.46.7+JER.46.8+JER.46.9+JER.46.10+JER.46.11+JER.46.12+JER.46.13+JER.46.14+JER.46.15+JER.46.16+JER.46.17+JER.46.18+JER.46.19+JER.46.20+JER.46.21+JER.46.22+JER.46.23+JER.46.24+JER.46.25+JER.46.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 46.2–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Ezek 29.1—32.32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is a message about Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is coming to Egypt, riding swiftly on a cloud. The Egyptian idols tremble before him, and the people of Egypt lose their courage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “I will stir up civil war in Egypt and turn brother against brother and neighbour against neighbour. Rival cities will fight each other, and rival kings will struggle for power. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am going to frustrate the plans of the Egyptians and destroy their morale. They will ask their idols to help them, and they will go and consult mediums and ask the spirits of the dead for advice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will hand the Egyptians over to a tyrant, to a cruel king who will rule them. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty, have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The water will be low in the Nile, and the river will gradually dry up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The channels of the river will stink as they slowly go dry. Reeds and rushes will wither, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and all the crops sown along the banks of the Nile will dry up and be blown away. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Everyone who earns his living by fishing in the Nile will groan and cry; their hooks and their nets will be useless. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who make linen cloth will be in despair; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weavers and skilled workers will be broken and depressed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The leaders of the city of Zoan are fools! Egypt's wisest people give stupid advice! How dare they tell the king that they are successors to the ancient scholars and kings? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King of Egypt, where are those clever advisers of yours? Perhaps they can tell you what plans the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty has for Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The leaders of Zoan and Memphis are fools. They were supposed to lead the nation, but they have misled it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has made them give confusing advice. As a result, Egypt does everything wrong and staggers like a drunken man slipping on his own vomit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one in Egypt, rich or poor, important or unknown, can offer help.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A time is coming when the people of Egypt will be as timid as women. They will tremble in terror when they see that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty has stretched out his hand to punish them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Egypt will be terrified of Judah every time they are reminded of the fate that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty has prepared for them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When that time comes, the Hebrew language will be spoken in five Egyptian cities. The people there will take their oaths in the name of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty. One of the cities will be called, “City of the Sun”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When that time comes, there will be an altar to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in the land of Egypt and a stone pillar dedicated to him at the Egyptian border. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will be symbols of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty's presence in Egypt. When the people there are oppressed and call out to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for help, he will send someone to rescue them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will reveal himself to the Egyptian people, and then they will acknowledge and worship him, and bring him sacrifices and offerings. They will make solemn promises to him and do what they promise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will punish the Egyptians, but then he will heal them. They will turn to him, and he will hear their prayers and heal them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When that time comes, there will be a highway between Egypt and Assyria. The people of those two countries will travel to and fro between them, and the two nations will worship together. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When that time comes, Israel will rank with Egypt and Assyria, and these three nations will be a blessing to all the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.24",
